source: tests/help.rs
expression: text
---
Record a visit to a directory

Usage: furet add [OPTIONS] --session <SESSION> <PATH>

Arguments:
  <PATH>  Directory to record, absolute or relative

Options:
      --session <SESSION>  Terminal session the visit belongs to
      --source <SOURCE>    What triggered the visit [default: hook] [possible values: hook, jump, back, up, fallback, import]
      --from <FROM>        Directory the visit started from
  -h, --help               Print help
